  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Reading this local test",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Queues:** `slot_metrics_live` runs real standalone activities; `slot_metrics_probe` exercises reserve/commit/cancel/release, duplicate, rejected, no-op and 30-second reservation expiry paths. Local Tally sanitizes hyphens in label values to underscores.\n\n**Slot gauges are last successful Batch observations.** They do not continuously read limiter state. The gauge panels select the newest observing host for each logical queue; the observation-age panel exposes stale observations. An idle gauge after expiry may change only at the next Batch. Missing samples mean unknown.\n\n**Persistence panels are cell-wide for the selected component.** These metrics have no namespace ID / task queue label, so the namespace and queue selectors do not filter them. Counts are persistence API attempts, not Cassandra statements. Typed errors include expected NotFound responses. Timers use seconds."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 18,
        "h": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Metrics target health",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "min(up{job=~\"$job\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red"
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green"
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Concurrency slots and observation freshness",
      "collapsed": false,
